<!--
Additional MSBuild properties for this project. Imported by AwardSpring.Net.csproj when
present, and listed in .fernignore so Fern does not overwrite it - the generator rewrites
this file from its stub on every run otherwise.

Description and Authors are here rather than in generators.yml because fern-csharp-sdk has
no config key for either: it constructs the csproj property by property and emits only
Version, PackageReadmeFile, the license, PackageProjectUrl and PolySharp. Left unset,
MSBuild substitutes the literal string "Package Description" - which is what nuget.org
shows in search results - and falls back to the assembly name for the author.

AssemblyName and AssemblyTitle are deliberately NOT set here. The assembly is already
AwardSpring.Net via the `namespace` config in sdk/fern/generators.yml, and overriding it
here would give that name two sources of truth.
-->
<Project>
  <PropertyGroup>
    <Description>Official AwardSpring API client for .NET.</Description>
    <Authors>AwardSpring</Authors>
    <Company>AwardSpring</Company>
  </PropertyGroup>
</Project>
